  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Act Naija! &#xbf; Civil Society Action to Strengthen Social Protection in Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project targets civil society by increasing accountability, public awareness, and engagement in social protection policies, enhancing collaboration between civil society and the government (Result 1); strengthening local organisations and communities capacities to monitor and effectively deliver social protection programmes, enhancing accountability and responsiveness within the social protection system (Result 2); enhance mobilisation and advocacy efforts towards civil society, the government, and legislative bodies at both national and sub-national levels to strengthen social protection policies and implementation towards a more inclusive and responsive social protection system (Result 3) and strengthen local staff and stakeholders capacities to ensure participatory project management, integration of gender justice, cross-cultural dialogue, and the empowerment of minorities (Result 4).&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
